{title: 165 - Look, You Saints! the Sight Is Glorious}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #165 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 165}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Gm]Look, you saints, [Gbm]the [Gm]sight [Bb]is glorious,
[Bb]See [Adim]the [Bb]Man [Cm/G]of [Gm]sorrows [Dm]now;
[Dm/F]From the [Gm]fight [Gbm]returned [Bb]victorious,
[Bb]Every [Eb]knee [Adim]to [Dm]Him [Eb/Bb]shall [F/C]bow.
[Gm/Bb]Crown Him! [Dm]Crown [Gm/D]Him! [Cm/Eb]Crown [Dm]Him!
[Bb]Crown [Adim]Him! [Bb]Crown Him! Crown Him!
[Bb]Crowns become [Cm]the victor's [Adim]brow.
[Cm/Eb]Crowns become [F7/Eb]the victor's [Eb/Bb]brow.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Gm]Crown the Savior! angels [Bb/D]crown [Dm]Him!
[Bb]Rich [Adim]the [Bb]trophies [Gm]Jesus [Dm]brings;
[Dm/F]On the seat [Gm]of [Gbm]power [Bb]enthrone [Dm]Him
[Bb]While the [Eb]vault [Adim]of [Dm]heaven [F/C]rings.
[Gm/Bb]Crown Him! [Dm]Crown [Gm/D]Him! [Cm/Eb]Crown [Dm]Him!
[Bb]Crown [Adim]Him! [Bb]Crown Him! Crown Him!
[Bb]Crown the [Cm]Savior, King [Dm/A]of [Adim]Kings.
[Cm/Eb]Crown the [Eb]Savior, [F7/Eb]King [Dm]of [Eb/Bb]Kings.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Gm]Sinners in [Gbm]derision [Bb/D]crowned [Dm]Him,
[Bb]Mocking thus [Cm/G]the [Gm]Savior's [Dm]claim;
[Dm/F]Saints and [Gm]angels crowd [Bb]around [Dm]Him,
[Bb]Own [Adim]His [Cm/Eb]title, [Dm]praise [Eb/Bb]His [F/C]name.
[Gm/Bb]Crown Him! [Dm]Crown [Gm/D]Him! [Cm/Eb]Crown [Dm]Him!
[Bb]Crown [Adim]Him! [Bb]Crown Him! Crown Him!
[Bb]Spread abroad [Cm]the victor's [Adim]fame!
[Cm/Eb]Spread abroad [F7/Eb]the victor's [Eb/Bb]fame!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Gm]Hark! those bursts [Gbm]of [Gm]acclamation!
[Bb]Hark! [Adim]those [Bb]loud [Gm]triumphant [Dm]chords!
[Dm/F]Jesus takes [Gbm]the [Gm]highest [Bb/D]station;
[Bb]Oh, [Adim]what [Cm/Eb]joy [Eb]the [Dm]sight [Eb/Bb]affords!
[Gm/Bb]Crown Him! [Dm]Crown [Gm/D]Him! [Cm/Eb]Crown [Dm]Him!
[Bb]Crown [Adim]Him! [Bb]Crown Him! Crown Him!
[Bb]King of [Cm]kings and Lord [Dm/A]of [Adim]lords!
[Cm/Eb]King of [Eb]kings [F7/Eb]and Lord [Dm]of [Eb/Bb]lords!
{end_of_verse}
